<title>JORDAN: Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 6.69 pct.</title>
<headline>Jordan dinar overnight rates fall to 6.69 pct.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The weighted average overnight interbank rate on the Jordanian dinar rose slightly to 6.69 percent on Tuesday from 6.64 percent on Monday, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>It said six banks traded on the market in fifteen reported transactions with a total value of 22 million dinars ($31 million).</p>
<p>$1 = 0.708 dinar</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom +962 6 623 776</p>
